## 🔐 Security Best Practices

| Practice | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| **Prepared Statements** | Prevent SQL injection by separating code and data |
| **Password Hashing** | Use `password_hash()` and `password_verify()` |
| **Input Validation** | Sanitize and validate all user inputs |
| **HTTPS** | Encrypt traffic to prevent credential interception |
| **Rate Limiting** | Throttle login attempts to prevent brute force attacks |
| **CSRF Protection** | Use tokens for form submissions |
| **Security Headers** | Implement `X-Frame-Options`, `Content-Security-Policy` |

